  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "新希望"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳煒翰</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一年冬ê鹹酸苦澀沓沓仔講leh收成</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">真濟滋味tī生活中　浸出悲喜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">昨hng ê曆日　掀--開</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">每一个影跡　收割我飄撇ê過去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">子時ê鐘仔聲　透lām新春期待</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">閃爍ê煙火　為lán妝thānn烏色ê天</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hē願ê光　踏入世界ê祈禱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">夢想ê躊躇　勻勻仔飛出束縛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">落筆ê日記　印出我ê心內話</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ná像送入頭殼ê底片</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來回逼趕目標ê願望</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">眠夢se̍h街ê時tsūn　牽起年頭ê信念</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hiàng時厚厚ê sannh心tī空氣中se̍h-se̍h唸</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">祝福kap勉勵無聲無sueh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">做背後堅強ê靠山</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">重重疊疊ê經驗　寄望</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大漢換做實行ê聖旨</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心　恬恬仔放風吹</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">迷亂ê感覺　kā家己khàm tī心願迷宮</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寄批hōo拚勢leh jiok青春ê</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　少年家</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjULSyU90GKqjsQqQQcZStN0O49G_qJy_xfn0FpOHkE3aqIK7J_2FRxIgW1VsW-6jAmTCYAylU9YsNg_oxuhtSYjgUb4OrEupjxONHlsXsmE3hnLHGV2E_nXaj230jDMCzPdsy4OWtta3j2C4Jv63cYPPdpDUqi5C8nD02lIp2trfdzneFiKKtY3wmZpKpf/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1357%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjULSyU90GKqjsQqQQcZStN0O49G_qJy_xfn0FpOHkE3aqIK7J_2FRxIgW1VsW-6jAmTCYAylU9YsNg_oxuhtSYjgUb4OrEupjxONHlsXsmE3hnLHGV2E_nXaj230jDMCzPdsy4OWtta3j2C4Jv63cYPPdpDUqi5C8nD02lIp2trfdzneFiKKtY3wmZpKpf/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1357%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKDHHr4_HemD_8lXwEbUa-8XJeJcdMBt0N9_x2GXQJwDWcthu2Ah2DRYAviY28oGAqRx2tHdqefQw9abU7cAXb-5bVTF74YFz8BkY4t6eMyeOP8ZlMexQv0e93MxPFncJZJxKlcAtnL_-9Bskrm8GQRAV5N23fHVwdauImCeugjol2ZIl7dBK1U6lVDgz6/s1424/357%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8